# use_devenv is not provided by nix-direnv. It's provided by devenv's own direnvrc,
# which must be sourced separately.
#
# The eval "$(devenv direnvrc)" line sources devenv's own shell integration which
# defines the use_devenv function, and only then can use devenv be called
#
# nix-direnv provides use_flake and use_nix. devenv provides use_devenv — via its
# own direnvrc command. They are separate things and both need to be present.
eval "$(devenv direnvrc)"
use devenv
